<LegalLayout title="Medical Disclaimer" heading="Medical disclaimer" path="/medical-disclaimer/" description="Neovantis provides product and supply information for healthcare professionals. The website does not provide medical advice, diagnosis or treatment.">
  <h2>For healthcare professionals</h2>
  <p>The information on this website is intended for healthcare professionals and institutional buyers. It describes the specialist products {business.name} supplies and how to make a professional supply enquiry.</p>

  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>Nothing on this website is medical advice, a diagnosis or a recommendation for the treatment of any patient. Neovantis does not provide patient consultations, treatment settings or clinical technique guidance. Clinical decisions remain the responsibility of the treating healthcare professional.</p>
  <p>If you are a patient with questions about your care or a device, please speak to your healthcare provider.</p>

  <h2>Product use</h2>
  <p>Medical devices must be used in accordance with the manufacturer’s instructions for use and the applicable professional and regulatory requirements. Product information on this website is a summary and does not replace the instructions for use.</p>

  <h2>Regulatory information</h2>
  <p>Neovantis holds a medical device establishment licence from the South African Health Products Regulatory Authority (SAHPRA). This licence relates to Neovantis’s activities as a company; it is not an approval of individual products. Ask our team if you need product-level regulatory information.</p>

  <h2>Images</h2>
  <p>Images marked as illustrative are for general illustration only and do not depict specific Neovantis products.</p>
</LegalLayout>
